
# Food Safety Inspection Viewer

## Project Description
A simple web application for viewing and managing food safety inspection records using Node.js and Express.

## Technologies Used
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Node.js
- Express.js

## Features
1. Dashboard with inspection statistics
2. Add and delete inspection records
3. Search and filter inspections
4. Automatic pass or needs-attention status
5. Food safety guidelines
6. Interactive safety checklist
7. Responsive design

## Installation

1. Install Node.js.
2. Open the project folder in VS Code.
3. Open the terminal.
4. Run:

   npm install

5. Start the server:

   npm start

6. Open http://localhost:3000 in your browser.

## Note
This educational project stores data in memory.
New records are lost when the server restarts.
The inspection scores are sample data and are not official certifications.